Package: nepalallometry
Type: Package
Title: Allometric Estimation for Nepal's Forest Trees
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Santosh", "Ayer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ayer.sant@gmail.com")
Author: Santosh Ayer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Santosh Ayer <ayer.sant@gmail.com>
Description: Implements published allometric methods for estimating tree
    biomass, carbon, and volume in Nepal. Biomass and carbon pathways include
    equations and procedures from the Forest Research and Training Centre
    (2025), Sharma and Pukkala (1990), and Chave et al. (2014). Tree-volume
    estimation includes FRTC (2025) stem-volume equations and Sharma-Pukkala
    (1990) stem-volume equations combined, where applicable, with branch-volume
    ratios from Nepal's Forest Regulations 2079. The package provides auditable
    tree- and inventory-level workflows while retaining method-specific species
    coverage, units, component boundaries, calibration information, and source
    documentation.
